BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Festa Italiana North Carolina
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260920T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260920T160000
UID:a932dd67a566ed6b3d7df69bba1e0c61@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Festa Italiana North Carolina celebrates Italian culture and h
 eritage in the Triangle while providing financial support to local chariti
 es. The festival is held Saturday\, September 20\, on Hunter Street and on
  the Town of Apex Government Campus. Events include live entertainment inc
 luding Italian dancers and other performers\, Galbani Culinary Stage\, Can
 noli-Eating Contest\, Zona Bambini (Kids Zone)\, food\, vendors\, wine and
  Bellini\, beer\, cash raffle\, and more. Whether you are Italian or just 
 love the culture\, please come join us for a great day in the Town of Apex
 !
LOCATION:Apex\, NC
URL:https://business.apexchamber.com/events/details/festa-italiana-north-c
 arolina-09-20-2026
X-SOURCE:Apex Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
